    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0380-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "Useful treatment options in those \nexpected to live only for a few \nweeks.\nDexamfetamine 2.5–20mg a \nday46,47\n",
      "bbox": [
        118.49940490722656,
        106.7779769897461,
        416.9095153808594,
        150.50299072265625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "1573ef7815e06b22c45a1b9a6d34d508196d545d52ae0656f04c4f2ec2773ef5"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0380-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "Beneficial effects \nseen on mood, \nfatigue and pain\n",
      "bbox": [
        232.49940490722656,
        131.80287170410156,
        288.1868591308594,
        160.50537109375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a04cbab4827ec9860a14f76cd3b6889b07895c5b224f1430711c0e44a8e2a135"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0380-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "Methylphenidate 20mg/\nday + mirtazapine 30mg/day48\n",
      "bbox": [
