    {
      "block_id": "page-0380-block-0026",
      "order": 26,
      "text": "Methylphenidate 5–20mg/day60\nLimited data\nPsychostimulants not appropriate \ntherapy. Standard antidepressant \npreferred.\nDexamfetamine 2.5–30mg/\nday61,62\n",
